  {
   "id": "b17-text-9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 777,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 71271,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: D’s label stays at the bottom, the repair goes on top",
   "originalText": "The rule: D’s label stays at the bottom, the repair goes on top",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b17-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 624,
   "height": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "last segment is PrefixSID(D)   →  nothing to add\nlast segment is AdjSID(X→D)    →  add PrefixSID(D) after it\nlist empty after clean-up      →  the list is just [PrefixSID(D)]\n\nextra labels  =  segments − 1",
   "originalText": "last segment is PrefixSID(D)   →  nothing to add\nlast segment is AdjSID(X→D)    →  add PrefixSID(D) after it\nlist empty after clean-up      →  the list is just [PrefixSID(D)]\n\nextra labels  =  segments − 1",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b17-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 276,
   "width": 962,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Before the failure the packet already carries D’s label (SRGB 16000 + D’s SID index). The repair\n   list is pushed on top of it (RFC 9855 §7.1), so D’s label is always the last one.\n•  An Adj-SID only moves the packet over one link. After it, the packet still needs D’s label, or the\n   far end wouldn’t know where it goes.\n•  \"Extra labels\" counts only the repair list: the segments minus D’s own label.",
   "originalText": "•  Before the failure the packet already carries D’s label (SRGB 16000 + D’s SID index). The repair\n   list is pushed on top of it (RFC 9855 §7.1), so D’s label is always the last one.\n•  An Adj-SID only moves the packet over one link. After it, the packet still needs D’s label, or the\n   far end wouldn’t know where it goes.\n•  \"Extra labels\" counts only the repair list: the segments minus D’s own label.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b17-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 393,
   "width": 543,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "All three endings in the examples (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "All three endings in the examples (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b17-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 427,
   "width": 773,
   "height": 158,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example        Row        Walk (after clean-up)       Added   Labels (top first)       Extra\n-------------  ---------  --------------------------  ------  -----------------------  -----\n2  ring        S → E      [P(B), P(E)]                –       16004, 16002             1\n5  leaf-spine  SP1 → L1   [P(SP2), P(L1)]             –       16002, 16011             1\n3  ring, B–C   S → C      [P(B), Adj(B→C)]            P(C)    16004, 24005, 16005      2\n4  ISP core    PE1 → P1   [Adj(P2→P1)]                P(P1)   24000, 16001             1\n4  ISP core    PE2 → P3   [Adj(P4→P3)]                P(P3)   24002, 16003             1\n7  parallel    S → E      [ ]                         P(E)    16002                    0\n1  square      S → D      [P(D)]                      –       16004                    0",
   "originalText": "Example        Row        Walk (after clean-up)       Added   Labels (top first)       Extra\n-------------  ---------  --------------------------  ------  -----------------------  -----\n2  ring        S → E      [P(B), P(E)]                –       16004, 16002             1\n5  leaf-spine  SP1 → L1   [P(SP2), P(L1)]             –       16002, 16011             1\n3  ring, B–C   S → C      [P(B), Adj(B→C)]            P(C)    16004, 24005, 16005      2\n4  ISP core    PE1 → P1   [Adj(P2→P1)]                P(P1)   24000, 16001             1\n4  ISP core    PE2 → P3   [Adj(P4→P3)]                P(P3)   24002, 16003             1\n7  parallel    S → E      [ ]                         P(E)    16002                    0\n1  square      S → D      [P(D)]                      –       16004                    0",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b17-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 595,
   "width": 852,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
