   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Node mode (B19): the same rule. Example 8 ends\n   [P(C), P(D)] = 16005, 16006.\n•  With PHP on, the last router before D pops D’s\n   label (packet walk, A7). The stack is shown\n   before that.\n•  Label values: B18.",
   "originalText": "•  Node mode (B19): the same rule. Example 8 ends\n   [P(C), P(D)] = 16005, 16006.\n•  With PHP on, the last router before D pops D’s\n   label (packet walk, A7). The stack is shown\n   before that.\n•  Label values: B18.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
